  "solution": "Let's apply each option on the given equation:\n\n15 * 2 * 18 * 6 * 3 * 30\n\nOption 1) ×, +, ÷, -, =\n\n15 × 2 + __18 ÷ 6__ - 3 = 30\n\n__15 × 2__ + 3 - 3 = 30\n\n__30 + 3__ - 3 = 30 \n\n__33 - 3__ = 30 \n\n30 = 30 \n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ​×, +, -, ÷, =\n15 × 2 + 18 - __6____ ÷ 3__ = 30\n__15 × 2__ + 18 - 2 = 30\n__30 + ____18__ - 2 = 30\n__48 - 2__ = 30 \n\n46 ≠ 30 \n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) ​+, ÷, -, ​×, =\n15 + __2 ÷ 18__ - 6 × 3 = 30\n15 + 0.1 - __6 × 3 __= 30\n__15 + 0.1__ - 18 = 30\n__15.1 - 18 = 30__ \n-2.9 ≠ 30 \nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4)÷, -, ​×, +, =\n__15 ÷ 2__ - 18 ​× 6 + 3 = 30\n7.5 - __18 ​× 6__ + 3 = 30\n__7.5__ - 108 __+ 3__ = 30\n__10.5 - 108__ = 30 \n-97.5 ≠ 30 \nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n Hence **the correct answer is \"****×, +, ÷, -, =**\".\n\n9c:Tf41,\n&",
